  "transcript": [
    {
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 8160,
      "text": "Customer: Hi, there. I'm interested in taking up yoga classes. Can you give me some information"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 8160,
      "endMs": 15080,
      "text": "Staff: Hello, sure thing. Our current course will end on June 20th and the coach will need to take a break. The new course will then start on June 27th."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 15080,
      "endMs": 20840,
      "text": "Customer：That sounds great. Where are the classes held?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 20840,
      "endMs": 24240,
      "text": "Staff：The course will be delivered at a hotel in Swavesey. Let me spell it, S-W-A-V-E-S-E-Y."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 24240,
      "endMs": 33120,
      "text": "We choose this venue because it has enough open floor space for students to comfortably move and practice yoga poses without feeling cramped."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 33120,
      "endMs": 38080,
      "text": "Customer: What level is the course for? I'm a beginner, so I don't want to be too advanced."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 38080,
      "endMs": 48680,
      "text": "Staff: The course is for intermediate-level students. Unfortunately, beginner's courses and advanced classes are not available at the moment as coaches are taking annual leave."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 48680,
      "endMs": 63880,
      "text": "Customer: Okay, thank you. How much does it cost?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 63880,
      "endMs": 76080,
      "text": "Staff: The course charge is £285, which is really competitive. Many course providers usually charge £320 to £350."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 76080,
      "endMs": 81760,
      "text": "Customer: That's a great price. Is there anything else I need to know about the classes?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 81760,
      "endMs": 87880,
      "text": "Staff: Morning training lasts for 2 hours and students will train under the supervision of the coach."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 87880,
      "endMs": 92920,
      "text": "Training is intensive and the last half hour is used for relaxation."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 92920,
      "endMs": 99320,
      "text": "Customer: Do you provide meals? Staff: Yes, lunch is covered in the course fee, but we only provide a variety of vegetarian food."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 99320,
      "endMs": 104480,
      "text": "It is conducive to practice."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 104480,
      "endMs": 107400,
      "text": "Customer: What else do students do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 107400,
      "endMs": 114400,
      "text": "Staff: Students will take part in some other activities in the afternoon, including walking and swimming."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 114400,
      "endMs": 125040,
      "text": "Engaging in these activities can help to improve heart health, lower blood pressure and reduce the risk of chronic diseases like diabetes and cardiovascular disease."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 125040,
      "endMs": 130920,
      "text": "Customer: Can we do anything else? Staff: Yes, you can also try horse riding, but you need to book in advance"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 130920,
      "endMs": 135720,
      "text": "because spots are limited. And is there anything else available?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 135720,
      "endMs": 140200,
      "text": "Students can also play tennis, which is free of charge, but they have to bring the racket"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 140200,
      "endMs": 142040,
      "text": "themselves."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 142040,
      "endMs": 145960,
      "text": "Customer: One last question. Is the yoga class held inside the club?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 145960,
      "endMs": 152240,
      "text": "Staff: No, the yoga class is held outside the club. Practicing yoga in an outdoor setting can"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 152240,
      "endMs": 157240,
      "text": "help students to connect with nature and feel more grounded and centered."
    }
  ],
